  "body": "Analysis code corresponding to the final manuscript.\n\n- Time-varying Cox models (counting-process export in Python, refit in R with `survival::coxph`, Efron ties, patient-clustered variance, `cox.zph` checks, log-time interaction specifications).\n- Measured-delirium and outcome-window code (CAM-ICU agreement, recorded sequence, time-windowed KDIGO in eICU).\n- Phenotype and consistency checks (eICU free-text pattern matching, reclassification of encephalitis-only stays, DerSimonian-Laird pooling).\n- Figure code for Figures 1-4 and Supplementary Figures S1-S3.\n- `sql/extract_mimiciv_sens.sql` and `analyze.py`: eGFR now uses the same 48-hour baseline creatinine as `baseline_creat`.\n\nNo patient-level data are included."
